{
  "about": "The strict compat rule's cases, read by NativeOptionsTest (the engine) and vitroCompat.test.ts (the site's checker), so both route each config the same way and word its first reason the same. route: native (drawn by Vitro), island (a custom card the island draws, every script a Lovelace resource) or frontend (its view opens in HA's frontend). reason: the first reason, when the route isn't native.",
  "cards": [
    { "what": "B2/I1: an input_number row (a slider, EntityRowControls)", "route": "native",
      "card": { "type": "entities", "entities": ["sensor.a", "input_number.target"] } },
